you know we like kids to know that all  dreams are possible if you believe in  yourself  january 26th is a hard day for the  bryant family  this time last year kobe bryant and his  13 year old daughter gianna were killed  in a helicopter crash  and on tuesday kobe's wife and gigi's  mom  vanessa bryant paid tribute to them by  sharing a touching letter written by one  of the late  teen's friends in the note posted on  instagram  gigi's friend aubry wrote that she's  thinking and praying for vanessa  constantly and cannot begin to  comprehend what she's going through  gianna's smile and attitude pushed me to  be better  you have probably heard this but if i  ever become a mom  i hope my daughter turns out exactly as  yours did  aubry remembered her friend as someone  who was kind caring and endlessly polite  who taught her and her other friends to  be better versions of themselves  and while aubrey noted that she's had a  pit of despair thinking about gianna and  what she could have accomplished had she  had a couple more years  she's tried to refocus her thoughts on  the marks she did leave on this earth  i can say that she changed our lives her  simple actions made all of us  a better person and i believe that the  results of this will never stop  appearing  and if all that wasn't sweet enough  gigi's friend concluded her letter with  a compliment to vanessa for raising  such a standout young woman writing you  did it right mrs bryant  and we are all eternally grateful to you  vanessa shared the letter alongside a  lengthy caption that read in part  quote i miss my baby girl and kobe kobe  so much adding i will never understand  why how this tragedy could have happened  to such  beautiful kind and amazing human beings  it still doesn't seem real  kobe we did it right she's amazing  you were there i was there i was there  taking pictures helping  you know doing everything i possibly can  to make the process easier for my wife  and you know but ultimately  you know she did all the work i was just  there just trying to help out  and vanessa she couldn't be more  grateful for all the love and support  a source tells et that the 38 year old  and the three other daughters she shared  with kobe  18 year old natalia four-year-old bianca  and one-year-old capri  have been extremely thankful for their  friends and family who have helped them  cope with the tragedy  our responsibility is to always inspire  and try to take some of the life lessons  that we have learned  and share those with the next generation  so that they can start  their journey with a lego the source  adds that vanessa plans to continue to  honor kobe and gianna's legacy and has  some projects in the works to do  just that one of those projects is  taking control over kobe's production  studio  according to the la times vanessa is now  the president  and ceo of granity studios which was  founded in 2013  and is best known for producing kobe's  animated short  deer basketball which won the nba star  in  oscar in 2018. my heart can take the  pounding  my mind can handle the grind but my body  knows it's time to say goodbye  and that's okay i'm ready to let you go  [Music]
 

